stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending : student submits form
  pending --> approved : teacher approves
  pending --> rejected : teacher rejects (reason required)
  approved --> ongoing : teacher marks started
  ongoing --> completed : teacher marks completed (only on/after end date)
  rejected --> [*]
  completed --> [*] : hours added to CAS record
  note right of approved : visible in search and accepts join requests
